[2025-07-22 23:15:09 INF] JobId=049c66b6-8e18-48f9-99bf-3f98358e591e QnetTransform.LLMUtils.Interfaces.ILLMInvoker: Response JSON returned from API: {"response":"# Code Modernization Summary: .NET 6.0 to .NET 8.0 Migration\n\nThe code changes reflect a migration from .NET 6.0 to .NET 8.0 with Entity Framework Core, focusing on restructuring namespaces and updating package references. The migration includes namespace reorganization for better code organization and updated EF Core package references.\n\n## Key Technical Changes:\n\n* **Framework Update**\n  * Migrated from .NET 6.0 to .NET 8.0\n  * Updated all NuGet package references to compatible versions\n  * Added explicit EntityFramework 6.5.1 dependency\n\n* **Namespace Reorganization**\n  * Changed `ApplicationDbContext` namespace from `EFCore.Data` to `EFCore.Data.Context`\n  * Renamed `ProductDbContext` to `ProductContext` for naming consistency\n  * Renamed `Queries` static class to `ProductQueries` for better specificity\n\n* **Project Structure**\n  * Removed legacy `packages.config` in favor of the SDK-style project format\n  * Updated `csproj` file structure with alphabetized properties\n  * Package references now use direct `PackageReference` format\n\n* **Class Renaming**\n  * Renamed `ApplicationDbContextFactory` to `ApplicationDbContextDesignTimeFactory` for clearer purpose indication\n  * Renamed `Queries` to `ProductQueries` for more specific domain scope\n\nThe migration maintains all existing functionality while modernizing the codebase structure and dependencies for .NET 8.0 compatibility."}.
